{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"s31abb35a94dac2ca","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-e77b0517dc55f210c7d5","text":"合成机爆炸了？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4c12636efcd1dda0973a","text":"合成机爆炸了？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-7d456e82863bfeb327c5","text":"…没有","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-cb170f936ecd6c9be20f","text":"区区几份「难吃的炒饭」而已，不会爆炸的","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f7561c5b81a81d791401","text":"房门打不开了？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-afa7a82ffff7df5bbe13","text":"房门打不开了？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-3858b96f65ee03509315","text":"…没有","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6026f8723e261c18f83d","text":"真有的话，得开始写《星穹列车七大不思议》了","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0c6370453b4380d2bbd7","text":"找不到帕姆了？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-dd0b6186018a1a60ce27","text":"找不到帕姆了？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-5f3262af1d58f1a1f780","text":"…没有","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-3dd0a49a239bcbd781de","text":"好可怕哦，我都不敢想象找不到帕姆的列车","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-3195238705725d3b8776","text":"等等，你这都是什么应激反应:(","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-534af091b01dc5dab113","text":"我就是问问你在干嘛","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-62402f607c48f1025683","text":"在刷花萼！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-200942c078b0d35a3cc9","text":"在刷花萼！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-a6382087be34250347f9","text":"喔…你的肝还好吗","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-4190b5a2c28396242e41","text":"信用点？还是光锥？","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-7a9f2e0881dc0a01138a","text":"[开拓者]好辛苦哦","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-f31618699bb1c89ceb75","text":"要我陪你吗","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-52fa20a2f3224b9aab1a","text":"好呀","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-6e3dc4c7d54ce6f36c50","text":"好耶，我来啦","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-305b4ace6a5e1c590fc5","text":"在做委托！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-17058316ea23c3696e3c","text":"在做委托！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0ab9c40100a8656c3c48","text":"喔…你好主动啊","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0158cc107b4711cfc3a2","text":"[开拓者]已经是合格的无名客啦","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c92f824dac9c118a88c1","text":"有什么好玩的委托，记得叫我一起","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-e7246c7688d8bba228b3","text":"好呀","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c65037253a437ad99504","text":"在…无所事事！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-266eaa43a1a1071cb79f","text":"在…无所事事！","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-0898e9612982b954b4be","text":"喔…你这么闲吗","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-ac75835d64ab061d201b","text":"既然[开拓者]这么闲，怎么不回列车呀","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-7eebbd09e72eee4de863","text":"陪我聊聊天也好嘛","speaker":"三月七"},{"id":"other-message-p7469-990975cc461c41f01230","text":"好呀","speaker":""}]}
